### Sprint 2 tests (after refactoring) – run with the REST Client extension in VS Code (API on port 3000)
### Reset the database before running them all again (re-import the export, then run database/sprint-2.sql)

### 1. Tutor's languages for the booking form – expect 200, Korean
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tutors/7/languages

### 2. Tutor not approved yet – expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tutors/52/languages

### 3. Book a lesson – expect 201 and the new lesson
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-02T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 4. Same booking again – expect 409 (clash)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-02T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 5. Tutor already has a lesson 15:00–16:00 on 6 December – expect 409
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/62/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "A1", "startTime": "2026-12-06T15:30:00Z", "durationMinutes": 30 }

### 6. Ends exactly when the tutor's next lesson starts – expect 201
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/62/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "A1", "startTime": "2026-12-06T14:30:00Z", "durationMinutes": 30 }

### 7. Learner already has a lesson at 09:00 on 10 December with another tutor – expect 409
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 1, "languageId": 1, "level": "A2", "startTime": "2026-12-10T09:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 30 }

### 8. Same time as a cancelled lesson on 7 December – expect 201 (cancelled lessons do not block)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/62/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 10, "languageId": 2, "level": "A2", "startTime": "2026-12-07T09:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 30 }

### 9. Time sent with a UK offset instead of Z – expect 201
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/63/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 23, "languageId": 5, "level": "C1", "startTime": "2026-12-03T19:00:00+00:00", "durationMinutes": 30 }

### 10. Tutor does not teach that language – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 1, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 11. Tutor not approved – expect 404 (same as test 2)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 52, "languageId": 11, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 12. tutorId belongs to a learner – expect 404
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 62, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 13. No learner with this ID – expect 404
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/9999/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 14. Learner ID belongs to a tutor – expect 404
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/7/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 8, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 15. Learner ID not a number – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/abc/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 16. Level not A1–C2 – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "D1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 17. Length not 30 or 60 – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 45 }

### 18. Length sent as text – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-12-04T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": "60" }

### 19. Start time with no time zone – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-11-27T18:00", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 20. Start time in the past – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-01-10T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 21. Date that does not exist – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2026-13-45T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 22. 30 February – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tutorId": 7, "languageId": 2, "level": "B1", "startTime": "2027-02-30T18:00:00Z", "durationMinutes": 60 }

### 23. Missing fields – expect 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons
Content-Type: application/json

{ }

### 24. New lesson shows in the Sprint 1 endpoint – expect lesson from test 3 in the list
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?limit=50

### 25. Tutor ID not a number – expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tutors/abc/languages

### 26. Learner ID not a number in the Sprint 1 endpoint – expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/abc/lessons/upcoming

### 27. limit over 50 – expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/api/learners/61/lessons/upcoming?limit=51
